      "title": "Crown Verification Checklist",
      "text": "## Crown Verification Checklist\n\nFor a crown-related case, prepare questions about:\n\n- Eligibility on the anticipated date of service\n- Coverage category for the crown procedure\n- Applicable deductible\n- Annual maximum and remaining maximum\n- Crown replacement frequency or limitation\n- Date of any previous crown on the same tooth\n- Waiting period\n- Missing-tooth or replacement-related limitations when relevant\n- Downgrade or alternate-benefit provisions\n- Preauthorization or predetermination requirements\n- Documentation requirements\n- Tooth-specific limitations when applicable\n\nDo not state that a crown is covered until benefits are confirmed directly with the payer.",
